==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la}} ''[[insincerus]]''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɪə(ɹ)}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# ''Of a person'', not genuinely meaning what has been expressed; [[sincere]]
#: ''Janice's rude behavior showed that her apology was insincere.''
# not [[serious]]

